SUMMARY:Adam Ferrara LIVE at Chicago Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nAdam Ferrara LIVE at Chicago Improv\nAdam Ferrara brings his acclaimed stand-up comedy to the Chicago Improv in Schaumburg for a night of laughs. Known for his sharp wit and hilarious storytelling\, Ferrara is a veteran comedian and actor who never fails to deliver an unforgettable performance. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: General Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink minimum per person \nAbout Adam Ferrara\nAdam Ferrara is a New York-based stand-up comedian and actor best known for his roles on the TV series “Rescue Me” and as a co-host on “Top Gear USA.” His comedy blends personal storytelling with sharp observations about life\, family\, and relationships. Ferrara has appeared on numerous late-night shows and is a favorite on the comedy club circuit. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, storytelling-driven stand-up comedy\nHilarious observations about life and relationships\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located inside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs in the Chicago area. The venue offers a full menu and bar service in an intimate showroom setting perfect for live comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $29.49. Available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ferrara-live-at-chicago-improv/
LOCATION:Chicago Improv\, 5 Woodfield Mall\, Schaumburg\, IL\, 60173\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/949/e0daf0ab-4e0f-4b84-8420-af33a2010949_973911_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
GEO:42.0453811;-88.0375314
