SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at PPG Paints Arena (July 30)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nNate Bargatze is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, known for his clean\, relatable humor and masterful storytelling. Hailing from Old Hickory\, Tennessee\, Nate grew up in a household steeped in comedy — his father is a former clown turned magician\, which gave Nate a unique perspective on performance from an early age. \nWith a style that blends self-deprecating wit\, Southern charm\, and perfectly timed observations about everyday life\, Nate has become a household name. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon multiple times\, released multiple Netflix specials including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average American\, and Hello World\, and sold out arenas across the country. \nHis Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is his most ambitious tour yet — a massive arena run that showcases why Nate Bargatze is considered one of the top stand-up comedians working today. Fans can expect his signature blend of slow-burn storytelling\, hilarious family anecdotes\, and the kind of comedy that makes you laugh until your sides hurt. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open approximately 6:00 PM)\nVenue: PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\nPhone: (412) 642-1800\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome; content is clean and family-friendly\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nPPG Paints Arena is Pittsburgh’s premier indoor entertainment venue\, located in the heart of downtown Pittsburgh at 1001 Fifth Avenue. With a seating capacity of approximately 18\,387\, it is one of the largest arenas in Pennsylvania and serves as the home of the Pittsburgh Penguins NHL team. \nThe arena features state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple concession levels\, premium club seating\, and luxury suites. The venue is known for its excellent sightlines from virtually every seat in the house\, making it an ideal setting for large-scale comedy performances. The Lower Level offers an intimate arena experience\, while the Upper Level provides sweeping views of the entire stage. \nPPG Paints Arena is easily accessible via public transit\, with multiple bus routes and the Light Rail (T) stopping nearby at Steel Plaza and Gateway stations. Parking is available in several nearby garages including the Arena Parking Garage directly adjacent to the venue. The arena is fully ADA accessible with dedicated seating areas and accessible entrances throughout. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy performance by Nate Bargatze as part of his Big Dumb Eyes World Tour. The show will feature Nate performing his brand-new material in a full arena setting\, complete with professional production\, lighting\, and sound. \nNate’s shows are known for being incredibly welcoming to all audiences — his clean comedy style means this is a perfect night out for couples\, families\, and groups of friends alike. Expect an evening filled with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartwarming stories\, and the kind of comedy that stays with you long after the show ends. \nArrive early to find your seats and grab concessions before the show begins. The arena fills up quickly for Nate Bargatze performances\, so plan to arrive at least 30-45 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $100 – $732+ (resale prices vary) \nOfficial tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are available through VividSeats with all-in pricing and a 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-ppg-paints-arena-july/
LOCATION:PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, Pennsylvania\, 15219\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/969958b2-3e23-41ae-a1e8-8be73f5463af_CUSTOM-IMFUca.jpg
GEO:40.4393097;-79.9895529
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=PPG Paints Arena 1001 Fifth Avenue Pittsburgh Pennsylvania 15219 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1001 Fifth Avenue:geo:-79.9895529,40.4393097
END:VEVENT
