SUMMARY:Comedy Cellar Las Vegas LIVE at Comedy Cellar at Rio Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nComedy Cellar Las Vegas LIVE at Comedy Cellar at Rio Las Vegas\n \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PT\nVenue: Comedy Cellar at Rio Las Vegas\nAddress: 3700 W Flamingo Rd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89103\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event \nAbout Comedy Cellar Las Vegas\nThe Comedy Cellar is one of the most storied comedy clubs in the world\, originally founded in New York City’s Greenwich Village. The Las Vegas outpost at the Rio Hotel brings the same intimate atmosphere and world-class comedy talent to the Strip. The club has been a launching pad for legends like Dave Chappelle\, Jerry Seinfeld\, and Louis C.K.\, and continues to feature top touring comedians nightly. \nWhat to Expect\n\nMultiple top-tier stand-up comedians per show\nIntimate club atmosphere with great sightlines\nSharp\, unfiltered comedy from touring professionals\nTwo shows nightly (7:00 PM and 9:30 PM)\nFull bar service available during the show\nApproximately 90 minutes of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\n \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $42 to $64. This is an 18+ event. General Admission\, Preferred GA\, and VIP seating options are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-cellar-las-vegas-live-at-comedy-cellar-at-rio-las-vegas-2/
LOCATION:Comedy Cellar at Rio Las Vegas\, 3700 W Flamingo Rd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89103\, USA
