SUMMARY:Alonzo Bodden LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nAlonzo Bodden is one of America’s most respected stand-up comedians\, best known for winning Season 3 of NBC’s hit reality competition Last Comic Standing. With over 25 years of experience making audiences laugh across the globe\, Bodden has established himself as a sharp\, intelligent voice in comedy. \nA regular panelist on NPR’s beloved quiz show Wait Wait… Don’t Tell Me!\, Bodden brings a uniquely thoughtful perspective to his stand-up. His comedy blends keen social observation\, political commentary\, and everyday life experiences — all delivered with a cool\, laid-back style that feels both effortless and razor-sharp. \nBefore comedy\, Bodden worked as a jet mechanic for Lockheed and McDonnell Douglas for nine years — a background that gives his material a grounded\, working-class authenticity. He has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Comedy Central\, and released his own Showtime comedy special. Fans can expect a night of smart\, laugh-out-loud comedy that covers everything from pop culture to politics to the absurdities of modern life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\nAddress: 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Restriction: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID required\nBeverage Minimum: 2-drink minimum per person\nAdditional Dates: Also performing Fri Jul 31 at 7:00 PM and Sat Aug 1 at 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Irving is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’s premier stand-up comedy clubs\, located in the heart of the Las Colinas urban center in Irving\, Texas. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this venue delivers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere that puts fans close to the action. \nThe club is situated inside the vibrant Toyota Music Factory entertainment complex at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130 — a destination packed with restaurants\, bars\, and entertainment options. The venue features a full bar\, table seating\, and a dedicated stage designed to maximize the comedy experience. With a capacity that keeps the room feeling personal and energetic\, every seat feels like a great seat. \nParking is available throughout the Toyota Music Factory complex\, with both surface lots and a parking garage nearby. The venue is easily accessible from major highways including I-635 and TX-114\, making it convenient for attendees coming from Dallas\, Fort Worth\, and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headlining stand-up comedy show featuring Alonzo Bodden performing his latest material. Expect a full evening of sharp observational humor\, political wit\, and storytelling that draws from Bodden’s unique life experiences — from his days as an aircraft mechanic to his years touring the world as a comedian. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is recommended for mature audiences. The intimate club setting at Punch Line Irving means you’ll be close enough to feel every punchline land. Come ready to laugh\, enjoy a drink\, and experience one of comedy’s most respected voices live on stage. \nNote: This is an 18+ event. Please bring a valid\, government-issued photo ID. A 2-beverage minimum per person applies. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $32 – $75 depending on seating section. General Admission seating starts at $32. Preferred seating options are also available at higher price points. \nPurchase your official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats with their 100% Buyer Guarantee. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/alonzo-bodden-live-at-punch-line-irving/
LOCATION:Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX\, 75039\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/5d9195ef-4e6d-4757-bb42-48500f56dad7_CUSTOM-9vFg1S.jpg
GEO:32.8734455;-96.9445654
