SUMMARY:Carrot Top LIVE at Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nCarrot Top LIVE at Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino\nScott “Carrot Top” Thompson\, one of Las Vegas’s most beloved and longest-running comedy headliners\, brings his outrageous prop comedy show to the Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino on July 30\, 2026. Known for his wild red hair\, boundless energy\, and trunk full of hilarious props\, Carrot Top delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience that has made him a Las Vegas institution. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino\nAddress: 3900 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89119\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event \nAbout Carrot Top\nScott “Carrot Top” Thompson is one of the most recognizable comedians in the world\, famous for his prop-based comedy\, outrageous physical humor\, and signature red hair. He has been a Las Vegas headliner for over two decades\, performing thousands of shows at the Luxor. His act blends pop culture commentary\, inventive props\, and high-energy performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious prop comedy with hundreds of custom-made gags\nPop culture parody and sharp observational humor\nHigh-energy performance with non-stop laughs\nAudience interaction and surprise moments\nA Las Vegas comedy institution with decades of experience\nApproximately 90 minutes of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe Atrium Showroom at Luxor Hotel and Casino is an intimate theater located on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering excellent sightlines and a comfortable setting for comedy shows. The Luxor features world-class dining\, gaming\, and entertainment options before and after the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $30 to $75. This is an 18+ event. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
