SUMMARY:UpDating LIVE at Nevermore Hall
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nUpDating LIVE at Nevermore Hall\nUpDating is the first-of-its-kind viral sensation live dating comedy show where two real singles go on a blind date right before a live audience. It’s part comedy show\, part social experiment\, and 100% entertaining. Don’t miss this unique experience coming to Nevermore Hall in Baltimore on July 30\, 2026! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET\nVenue: Nevermore Hall\nAddress: 20 Market Place\, Baltimore\, MD\nAge Requirement: Check venue for details \nAbout UpDating\nUpDating is a groundbreaking live comedy show that combines the excitement of a blind date with the energy of a live comedy performance. Two real singles meet for the first time on stage in front of a live audience\, creating an unpredictable and hilarious experience. The show has gone viral for its authentic\, unscripted moments and laugh-out-loud comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nReal blind dates happening live on stage\nUnscripted\, authentic comedy moments\nAudience participation and interaction\nA unique blend of reality TV and live comedy\nHilarious commentary and hosting\nAn unforgettable night of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nNevermore Hall is a unique entertainment venue located at 20 Market Place in Baltimore\, MD\, offering an intimate setting perfect for live comedy and special events. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $72. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
