SUMMARY:Gabriel Fluffy Iglesias Live LIVE at Treasure Island Resort & Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nGabriel Fluffy Iglesias LIVE at Treasure Island Resort & Casino\n \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 5:30 PM CDT (9:30 PM show also available)\nVenue:\nAddress: 5734 Sturgeon Lake Road\, Welch\, MN 55089\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting from $97 \nAbout Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias\, known worldwide as “Fluffy\,” is one of America’s most successful stand-up comedians. He has starred in multiple Netflix specials\, his own sitcom Mr. Iglesias\, and has sold out arenas across the globe. His warm\, relatable humor and masterful storytelling have earned him a massive\, multigenerational fanbase. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from one of the biggest names in the business\nHilarious storytelling\, impressions\, and sound effects\nA family-friendly show suitable for all ages\nAn unforgettable night of laughter at a premier casino entertainment venue\nTwo show times available: 5:30 PM and 9:30 PM\n\nVenue Information\n \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $97 and are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Secure your seats early as this show is expected to sell out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
