SUMMARY:Jay Pharoah LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Jay Pharoah\nJay Pharoah is one of the most talented comedians and impressionists of his generation\, best known for his seven seasons on Saturday Night Live where he became famous for his uncanny celebrity impressions. \nHis spot-on portrayals of Will Smith\, Eddie Murphy\, Denzel Washington\, Kanye West\, and Barack Obama made him a fan favorite and one of SNL’s most memorable cast members. Originally from Virginia\, Pharoah developed his comedy skills at local clubs before touring the UK\, US\, and Montreal. \nBeyond impressions\, Pharoah is a sharp stand-up comedian with high energy\, crowd work\, and storytelling that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, located in the Waterfront entertainment complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. \nThe intimate showroom seats approximately 300 guests with excellent sightlines from every seat. A full-service bar and restaurant are on-site\, with a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parking is available throughout the Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I-376 and Route 837. Arrive early to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nJay Pharoah’s live show is a non-stop comedy experience blending stand-up\, impressions\, and crowd interaction. \nExpect jaw-dropping celebrity impressions woven into hilarious original material. His ability to transform into any celebrity on the spot is something that has to be seen live to be believed. \nThe Pittsburgh Improv typically features a local opener before the headliner takes the stage\, making for a complete evening of comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $25 – $65 depending on seating and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-pharoah-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
