SUMMARY:Bill Burr Live LIVE at Reno Events Center
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nBill Burr Live LIVE at Reno Events Center\nEmmy and Grammy Award nominee Bill Burr brings his signature\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy to Reno for one unforgettable night. Known for his fearless takes on modern life\, relationships\, and society\, Burr delivers a raw and hilarious performance that has made him one of the most celebrated comedians of his generation. Don’t miss this rare Reno appearance! \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Reno Events Center\nAddress: 400 University Way\, Reno\, NV 89501\nParking: Limited parking in National Bowling Stadium lot; additional public/private lots nearby\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nNote: This is a phone-free experience — all phones secured in Yondr pouches during the show \nAbout Bill Burr\nBill Burr is an Emmy and Grammy Award-nominated stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcaster widely regarded as one of the best comedians working today. Known for his unapologetic humor and sharp social commentary\, Burr has released multiple acclaimed Netflix specials and stars in the hit series “F Is for Family.” His Monday Morning Podcast is one of the most downloaded comedy podcasts in the world. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFearless\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from one of the best in the business\nSharp observations on modern life\, relationships\, and pop culture\nA phone-free experience — be fully present for every punchline\nHigh-energy performance in an intimate arena setting\nOne of the most anticipated comedy shows of 2026 in Reno\nLimited tickets remaining — less than 1% left!\n\nVenue Information\nThe Reno Events Center is a premier entertainment venue located in the heart of downtown Reno at 400 University Way. The facility offers excellent sightlines\, accessible seating\, and is conveniently located near major casinos and hotels. The venue enforces a clear bag policy — visit the RSCVA website for details. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $146 – $174 with very limited availability remaining. This is a phone-free event — Yondr pouches will be provided at the door. Please arrive early. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
