SUMMARY:John McCombs LIVE at CG's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJohn McCombs LIVE at CG’s Comedy Club\nJohn McCombs brings his hilarious stand-up comedy to CG’s Comedy Club in Bolingbrook for a night of laughs. A rising star in the Chicago comedy scene\, McCombs delivers sharp\, relatable humor that keeps audiences coming back for more. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: CG’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 619 E. Boughton Rd.\, Ste. 125\, Bolingbrook\, IL 60440\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nPhone: (630) 410-8906 \nAbout John McCombs\nJohn McCombs is a stand-up comedian known for his sharp observational humor and engaging stage presence. A regular on the Chicago comedy circuit\, McCombs has built a loyal following with his relatable takes on everyday life. His performances are consistently praised for their clever writing and natural delivery. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy\nIntimate comedy club setting at CG’s Comedy Club\nFull bar service available\nShow starts at 8:00 PM sharp\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nGreat night out in the Bolingbrook/Chicago suburbs\n\nVenue Information\nCG’s Comedy Club is located at 619 E. Boughton Rd. in Bolingbrook\, IL\, a popular comedy destination in the Chicago suburbs. The club features a full bar and an intimate showroom atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster and VividSeats. All shows are 21 and up. Contact the venue at (630) 410-8906 for more information. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
